      <activity id="f311b8a7-6a54-5c34-8913-ba21e9b6bcaa" activityNameId="7555913a-3aaa-5b74-815b-a9e372cb4538" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gold, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gold, at refinery
This data set describes the beneficiation, concentration and refinement of gold.;
CAS number: 007440-57-5; 
UUID: 3ebf252f-2de6-330c-abc4-1374f56a3f16
This data set describes the mining of gold concentrate in Tanzania. It includes energy and water consumption, land use, transports, waste disposal as well as emissions to air and water.
Location: Material requirements for gold concentration are estimated with Australian data. Emissions to water have been estimated with South-African, emissions to air with Australian data.
Technology: The mining of ore from open pit and underground mines is considered.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 11.57 t gold
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: See Geography, electricity mix has been estimated with foreign mix
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3ebf252f-2de6-330c-abc4-1374f56a3f16.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="84413a2b-0f73-5ed0-ba4e-13b30ff6f2a9" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
